What comes out
Direction + capacity protection.', '', null, 'Notion — Entrepalooza Curriculum & Evidence Lab · Module 7 working draft · Copy of Ashley Zeck workspace original · Oct 6, 2026 · edits here do not sync.', '- Equal language and time for every direction card.
