- Duplicate Module 8 closing ceremony.', 'https://www.notion.so/3f1ca793c2c581629f9de8aaf73f0ab2', 'Choose a Direction That Fits Capacity', 'Pick a direction card that fits your capacity', 'Existing card retained unchanged, as structure. Teaching on this card is not approved for participant delivery.', 'Accumulated evidence, a direction that fits now, uncertainty, and a reversible next decision.', 'pending_evaluator_and_clinical_review', '', '', 'Research and theory are used as design lenses, not as proof that Entrepalooza works. Related research does not prove that Entrepalooza works.', '', 9, 'Pass, respond in private, observe, pause, stop, or choose another direction.
