A missing worksheet is not a failed module.
Every decision fits one of these labels: Keep, Change, Test Again, Pause/Park, Stop, Another Direction, Continue Looking. "Still don''t know" lives under Continue Looking.', '', 'Status: Working replacement draft for review and rehearsal. Current thin Module 8 lesson cards remain unchanged until this draft is approved. Drops “From Obsession to Legacy” as the participant-facing title.', 'Oct 6, 2026', 'Review candidate — working replacement draft. Not approved teaching, and not part of the participant workbook.', '6ac8a3de20a10ee24ca3e1eb', '2026-10-09T08:20:46.097000'::timestamptz, '2026-10-14T16:34:33.717000'::timestamptz) on conflict (id) do update set "instructional_purpose" = excluded."instructional_purpose", "lesson_code" = excluded."lesson_code", "lesson_id" = excluded."lesson_id", "reviewer_notes" = excluded."reviewer_notes", "research_rationale" = excluded."research_rationale", "proposed_draft_text" = excluded."proposed_draft_text", "decision_note" = excluded."decision_note", "decided_date" = excluded."decided_date", "source_label" = excluded."source_label", "facilitator_boundaries" = excluded."facilitator_boundaries", "source_url" = excluded."source_url", "module_title" = excluded."module_title", "lesson_title" = excluded."lesson_title", "current_card_note" = excluded."current_card_note", "review_scope" = excluded."review_scope", "review_status" = excluded."review_status", "approval_decision" = excluded."approval_decision", "approved_version" = excluded."approved_version", "research_limitations" = excluded."research_limitations", "internal_notes" = excluded."internal_notes", "module_order" = excluded."module_order", "participation_alternatives" = excluded."participation_alternatives", "approver" = excluded."approver", "changes_requested" = excluded."changes_requested", "source_date" = excluded."source_date", "proposed_draft_label" = excluded."proposed_draft_label", "created_date" = excluded."created_date", "updated_date" = excluded."updated_date";
insert into public.tribe_thread ("module_order", "order", "prompt", "status", "guidance", "lesson_code", "practice", "title", "id", "created_date", "updated_date") values (1, 11, 'Has a conversation, demonstration, recommendation, or someone else''s work introduced you to something you hadn''t considered before? What surprised you?', 'open', 'No personal history or workbook response is required. Share only what you choose; don''t repost anyone else''s private story or journal entry. Reading without posting is welcome.', 'M1-L1', 'Share a discovery, a resource others could explore, or a question you would enjoy discussing. You can also respond to another person''s idea with a question or an additional possibility. The goal is to expand what people encounter, not identify anyone''s hidden passion.', 'What have you discovered through someone else?', '6ac89dc3a684924c432a9a66', '2026-10-09T07:54:43.232000'::timestamptz, '2026-10-17T03:06:15.844000'::timestamptz) on conflict (id) do update set "module_order" = excluded."module_order", "order" = excluded."order", "prompt" = excluded."prompt", "status" = excluded."status", "guidance" = excluded."guidance", "lesson_code" = excluded."lesson_code", "practice" = excluded."practice", "title" = excluded."title", "created_date" = excluded."created_date", "updated_date" = excluded."updated_date";
insert into public.tribe_thread ("title", "module_order", "lesson_code", "prompt", "practice", "guidance", "description", "order", "status", "id", "created_date", "updated_date") values ('What else could this attention be?', 1, 'M1-L2', 'When something holds your attention, what else might explain it besides a passion? Curiosity, worry, a responsibility, a habit, or someone else''s expectation all count. You do not have to name a passion, and you do not have to decide how intense it is.', 'Share one thing that has been holding your attention, if you want to, and one other explanation that could fit. "I don''t know yet" counts. Do not ask anyone to say whether it is a passion, or whether they should continue.', 'This thread stays with Module 1. Intensity, choice, and cost belong in Module 5, after a try. Take part only if you want to. You can listen, pass, or say you are not sure. Nothing here classifies a person.', 'A Module 1 conversation about what else attention can mean, besides a passion.', 12, 'open', '6ac89dc3a684924c432a9a67', '2026-10-09T07:54:43.232000'::timestamptz, '2026-10-20T03:20:43.558000'::timestamptz) on conflict (id) do update set "title" = excluded."title", "module_order" = excluded."module_order", "lesson_code" = excluded."lesson_code", "prompt" = excluded."prompt", "practice" = excluded."practice", "guidance" = excluded."guidance", "description" = excluded."description", "order" = excluded."order", "status" = excluded."status", "created_date" = excluded."created_date", "updated_date" = excluded."updated_date";
insert into public.tribe_thread ("module_order", "order", "prompt", "status", "guidance", "lesson_code", "practice", "title", "id", "created_date", "updated_date") values (10, 102, 'What would still work during a new job or a quiet season?', 'open', 'Mark each item as proposed or actually available. Something proposed is not something that exists yet.', 'M10-L2', 'Together, sketch a simple connection map: how often people want contact, which channels, and which group practices from earlier modules to keep.', 'How we stay connected', '6ac89dc3a684924c432a9a6b', '2026-10-09T07:54:43.232000'::timestamptz, '2026-10-15T04:40:51.342000'::timestamptz) on conflict (id) do update set "module_order" = excluded."module_order", "order" = excluded."order", "prompt" = excluded."prompt", "status" = excluded."status", "guidance" = excluded."guidance", "lesson_code" = excluded."lesson_code", "practice" = excluded."practice", "title" = excluded."title", "created_date" = excluded."created_date", "updated_date" = excluded."updated_date";
insert into public.tribe_thread ("module_order", "order", "prompt", "status", "guidance", "lesson_code", "practice", "title", "id", "created_date", "updated_date") values (10, 103, 'My connection choice:', 'open', 'No public story, mentoring, unpaid labour, venture continuation or permanent attendance is required, and no one is auto-enrolled in anything.', 'M10-L3', 'Three equal ways to stay connected:
1. Stay close: active connection with the group.
2. Light touch: updates, an annual check-in, optional events.
3. Private / pause: still a member, with no contact or delayed contact.

Optional roles, if you want one: host, peer witness or resource sharer. Each is voluntary, time-limited and can be dropped.', 'Choose your place in the tribe', '6ac89dc3a684924c432a9a6c', '2026-10-09T07:54:43.232000'::timestamptz, '2026-10-15T04:40:51.342000'::timestamptz) on conflict (id) do update set "module_order" = excluded."module_order", "order" = excluded."order", "prompt" = excluded."prompt", "status" = excluded."status", "guidance" = excluded."guidance", "lesson_code" = excluded."lesson_code", "practice" = excluded."practice", "title" = excluded."title", "created_date" = excluded."created_date", "updated_date" = excluded."updated_date";
insert into public.tribe_thread ("module_order", "order", "prompt", "status", "guidance", "lesson_code", "practice", "title", "id", "created_date", "updated_date") values (0, 2, 'Could you pass on a personal question without needing a reason?', 'open', 'Optional. Answer in your own words, read what others wrote, or pass. Nothing here asks you to describe anything personal.', 'O.2', 'Passing on a personal question does not require an explanation.

You have the right to choose what you share, to pass without defending the choice, to ask who can see stored information, to request correction, and to raise a concern.', 'What you share is yours to choose', '6ac89dc3a684924c432a9a64', '2026-10-09T07:54:43.232000'::timestamptz, '2026-10-09T07:54:43.232000'::timestamptz) on conflict (id) do update set "module_order" = excluded."module_order", "order" = excluded."order", "prompt" = excluded."prompt", "status" = excluded."status", "guidance" = excluded."guidance", "lesson_code" = excluded."lesson_code", "practice" = excluded."practice", "title" = excluded."title", "created_date" = excluded."created_date", "updated_date" = excluded."updated_date";
insert into public.tribe_thread ("module_order", "order", "prompt", "status", "guidance", "lesson_code", "practice", "title", "id", "created_date", "updated_date") values (0, 3, 'Which response would you choose: a question is okay, a suggestion is welcome, or no feedback right now?', 'open', 'Answer for yourself only. Nothing in this thread asks you to name, quote or describe anyone else.', 'O.3', 'Ask before giving advice, challenging an interpretation, or sharing someone''s work.
- Respect no, not now, passing, and changing one''s mind.
- Speak about an action or a piece of evidence; do not diagnose or assign an identity.
- Do not repeat someone''s personal story, or record or photograph them, without specific permission.', 'Permission before feedback', '6ac89dc3a684924c432a9a65', '2026-10-09T07:54:43.232000'::timestamptz, '2026-10-09T07:54:43.232000'::timestamptz) on conflict (id) do update set "module_order" = excluded."module_order", "order" = excluded."order", "prompt" = excluded."prompt", "status" = excluded."status", "guidance" = excluded."guidance", "lesson_code" = excluded."lesson_code", "practice" = excluded."practice", "title" = excluded."title", "created_date" = excluded."created_date", "updated_date" = excluded."updated_date";
insert into public.tribe_thread ("module_order", "order", "prompt", "status", "guidance", "lesson_code", "practice", "title", "id", "created_date", "updated_date") values (2, 22, 'Could you stop or change course?', 'open', 'Boredom, friction, no access, no opportunity and uncertainty are data. They are not evidence of a character flaw.', 'M2-L2', 'Reflection is not an essay and it is not a personality verdict. It is a short evidence check.

Keep your report separate from anyone else''s interpretation, and ask permission before naming a possible pattern in someone else''s work.', 'Ask before naming a pattern in someone else''s work', '6ac89dc3a684924c432a9a68', '2026-10-09T07:54:43.232000'::timestamptz, '2026-10-09T07:54:43.232000'::timestamptz) on conflict (id) do update set "module_order" = excluded."module_order", "order" = excluded."order", "prompt" = excluded."prompt", "status" = excluded."status", "guidance" = excluded."guidance", "lesson_code" = excluded."lesson_code", "practice" = excluded."practice", "title" = excluded."title", "created_date" = excluded."created_date", "updated_date" = excluded."updated_date";
insert into public.tribe_thread ("module_order", "order", "prompt", "status", "guidance", "lesson_code", "practice", "title", "id", "created_date", "updated_date") values (5, 53, 'What impression or assumption, if any, do you want to check?', 'open', 'There is no readiness judgement and no business direction implied here. Keep, change, test again, pause, stop, another direction, or continue looking all belong.', 'M5-L3', 'An intuition is an impression or a hunch. It can suggest a question, but it is not the same as evidence. Check what supports it, what challenges it, and what you do not yet know.', 'Check an impression with the group', '6ac89dc3a684924c432a9a69', '2026-10-09T07:54:43.232000'::timestamptz, '2026-10-09T07:54:43.232000'::timestamptz) on conflict (id) do update set "module_order" = excluded."module_order", "order" = excluded."order", "prompt" = excluded."prompt", "status" = excluded."status", "guidance" = excluded."guidance", "lesson_code" = excluded."lesson_code", "practice" = excluded."practice", "title" = excluded."title", "created_date" = excluded."created_date", "updated_date" = excluded."updated_date";
insert into public.tribe_thread ("module_order", "order", "prompt", "status", "guidance", "lesson_code", "practice", "title", "id", "created_date", "updated_date") values (10, 101, 'Our shared identity, in one line:', 'open', 'A short introduction of who you are now is enough; no life story, and nothing about hardship as a credential.', 'M10-L1', 'We are people who notice, try, reflect and decide, and who stay connected without forcing one outcome.

Every path belongs: employment, training, a project or venture, a pause, continuing to look, or leaving.', 'Who we are together', '6ac89dc3a684924c432a9a6a', '2026-10-09T07:54:43.232000'::timestamptz, '2026-10-15T04:40:51.342000'::timestamptz) on conflict (id) do update set "module_order" = excluded."module_order", "order" = excluded."order", "prompt" = excluded."prompt", "status" = excluded."status", "guidance" = excluded."guidance", "lesson_code" = excluded."lesson_code", "practice" = excluded."practice", "title" = excluded."title", "created_date" = excluded."created_date", "updated_date" = excluded."updated_date";
commit;
